      "id": "blk_4xf3q8t",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<p><b>Vayra X1 </b>is a<span style=\"font-size: 0.95rem;\">&nbsp;high-performance virtual reality system engineered for immersive PC-powered VR experiences across education, simulation, engineering visualisation, gaming, industrial training, and interactive content development.</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9ju6dro",
      "type": "image",
      "src": "data:image/webp;base64,",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_47ti0fj",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<h2>Key Features</h2><h3>4K High-Resolution Visuals</h3><p>High-resolution LCD display delivers detailed visuals with reduced screen-door effect for improved immersion.</p><h3>Ultra-Smooth 120Hz Refresh Rate</h3><p>Supports refresh rates up to 120Hz for fluid motion and improved VR comfort.</p><h3>Lightweight Ergonomic Design</h3><p>Lightweight headset architecture enhances comfort during extended VR sessions.</p><h3>Wide Field of View</h3><p>Wide 116° viewing angle improves immersion and spatial awareness within virtual environments.</p><h3>Inside-Out 6DoF Tracking</h3><p>Integrated inside-out tracking system eliminates the need for external base stations.</p><h3>SteamVR Compatible</h3><p>Compatible with SteamVR platforms and a broad range of PCVR applications.</p><h3>Flip-Up Visor Design</h3><p>Convenient flip-up headset mechanism allows quick transition between virtual and real environments.</p><h3>Built-In Audio System</h3><p>Integrated audio system delivers immersive sound without requiring external headphones.</p><h3>PC-Powered VR Performance</h3><p>Dedicated wired PCVR architecture enables stable high-quality VR rendering from powerful desktop and workstation systems.</p>"
    }
  ]
}